# Advanced Placement Economics. Microeconomics: Student Activities.

**Authors:** Morton, John S.

## Abstract
This book is designed to help advanced placement students better understand microeconomic concepts through various activities. The book contains 5 units with 73 activities, sample multiple-choice questions, sample short essay questions, and sample long essay questions. The units are entitled: (1) "The Basic Economic Problem"; (2) "The Nature and Functions of Markets"; (3) "The Theory of the Firm"; (4) "Factor Markets"; and (5) "The Role of Government." (EH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED424131

